itches focus back to the  class 1a students who are working on  evacuating the civilians of jakku  as the students are wondering what  happened to todoroki since he had  apparently gone out to find  deku and bakugo an important piece of  news shocks the civilians  in the crowd ida asks one of the  civilians to turn up the broadcast  and the reporter announces that a  gigantic villain is on his way to jakku  this villain is destroying everything in  his path and it looks like he is going  to smash through  multiple cities before finally arriving  in jakku  uraka is surprised because she knows  that most of the pro heroes were  assigned  to keeping the villains from the mansion  at bay and  then the final page shows a transformed  gigantomachia about to smash  his way through a city and as this  happens oblivious civilians are going  about their day just meters away  blissfully unaware  that everything around them is about to  be destroyed  we can see that gigantomachia's body has  changed  not only did his jaw go up over his eyes  as we saw in previous chapters but his  hands  seem to have transformed as well it  appears that his hands have now expanded  in a way that makes them more suitable  for bursting through obstacles and  annihilating  everything in sight and unfortunately  we all know what this means this means  the plan  that the students try to execute back at  the mansion has  clearly failed for some reason the  sleeping agent did not have an  effect on machia at least not yet and he  was able to defeat the heroes and  continue his march towards jakku  this is really bad news for a lot of  innocent civilians  in makia's path and also for the heroes  and hero students in jakku  who already have their hands full with  the absolutely broken shigaraki  needless to say this could also be very  bad news for the heroes and hero  students who were trying to stop makia  back at the mansion  right before we saw that final page with  makia in his new form about to pummel  through a city  we also saw a couple of quick shots of  absolute  carnage near the mansion and we could  see people in hero costumes  lying motionless on the ground this was  the aftermath of the attempt by the  heroes and hero students to stop  machia the aftermath of the battle that  was happening back in chapter 280.  fat gum majestic mount lady gang orca  and other important heroes were all  there and attacking machia when the  focus of the story shifted back to jakku  and now the next thing we know all of  the heroes have been overpowered and  makia  is about to continue his journey after  leaving the heroes  and the hero students in the dust so  what happened what happened to all those  heroes  and what happened to the heroes students  did machia just kill a bunch of them  off screen did we just lose some of our  favorite boku no hero characters without  even realizing it i certainly hope not  but it's definitely possible that  makia's rampage  led to some serious casualties it's a  similar situation to what happened when  shigaraki destroyed the hospital  and an entire section of jakku city we  can't be sure yet because of all the  chaos  but it definitely seems possible that a  bunch of heroes died  this is some crazy stuff right here and  this is literally deku's worst  nightmare deku always wanted to save  everyone he wanted to protect his  friends  and innocent people what happened to  gran torino in the previous chapter is  bad enough  but now deku has to face an even more  tragic reality  izawa just lost a limb the heroes and  hero  students at the mansion might have been  killed thousands of civilians are now in  direct danger as makia plows through  multiple cities on his way to jakku  and of course shigaraki has been able to  regenerate once again  after gaining full use of his quirks at  least for the time being  obviously this turn of events isn't just  bad for deku  this is the worst case scenario for all  of japan  the last thing that anyone wanted was  makia leveling multiple cities and  killing who knows how many civilians  on his way to jakku but the reason i am  singling out deku in particular  is because he is of course the main  protagonist and he is also an extremely  emotional person who dedicated his life  to saving as many people as possible  the events of these last few chapters  are sure to fundamentally alter  deku as a person i mean just think about  it  when deku learns that some of his  friends might have been killed or  seriously injured when he learns what is  happening to civilians in all of these  different cities  and when he learns about all the pro  heroes who lost their lives  this man will never be the same again i  mean just remember how deku reacted when  one single hero  sir naidi passed away now with  potentially  thousands of people losing their lives  deku is going to blame himself for not  being able to do more  he is definitely going to take these  tragedies very personally  and i think it's safe to say that the  deku we knew from before the war arc  is now gone forever just like shigaraki  underwent a drastic character  transformation in the my villain  academia arc  deku is about to undergo a major  character transformation  as well he is about to come face to face  with  tragedy with his inability to protect  everyone  and with the dark side of the hero  society  and the pro-hero profession this is  shaping up to be  the worst case scenario this is deku's  worst nightmare  and the events of this war arc are going  to change him forever  please let me know what you guys think  did gigantomachia just kill  a bunch of heroes and hero students off  screen  or do you think that all of them were  somehow able to survive  how do you feel about shigaraki  seemingly gaining the upper hand in  battle once again  and what do you think is going to happen  next finally  how do you think deku is going to react  when he learns what just happened  at the mansion and also what is  h